> My pet golden naga hatchling called Goldwurm stepped into a level
> teleport trap in the gnomish mines and dissappeared. How far (how many
> levels up or down) can he be?

It can be anywhere in the same branch as the trap (the Gnomish Mines in 
this case).  I'm not sure whether that includes levels you haven't been 
to or not; I think not, but last I looked at the source I had trouble 
deciphering it.

> I've searched a lot and am worries that I
> might not find him in time before he goes wild. How many turns does this
> take?
> 

Depends on how tame it was when it moved to a different level: tameness 
decreases by 1 point every 150 turns it's on a different level.  If it 
was well-fed, it should have had a tameness of 20, meaning it would take 
3000 turns to go feral.

> Will a pet that stepped into a polymorph trap stay in his new form for
> ever or just for a number of turns?

In vanilla nethack, forever.


